{"3642910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wyldheart", "steam_appid": 3642910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/e13d1e693b780a755fdd448990037540.poster.avif?t=1788246112\" aria-label=\"Split-screen animated GIF showing characters being customized with different types of moustaches and beards, hair colours and styles, and skin tones.\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/e13d1e693b780a755fdd448990037540.webm?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/e13d1e693b780a755fdd448990037540.mp4?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>YOU ARE NOT THE CHOSEN ONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a humble peasant tossed into a dungeon, tasked with finding one of the ancient Relics of Caerwyn to protect your town. Choose to be a proud Freefolk, a little Mossling, or a towering Grimhorn, and pick from 19 backgrounds to begin your story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/098828e10c56e5c62af16b8a3bd78332.poster.avif?t=1788246112\" aria-label=\"Animated GIF of an archer, swordsman, and wizard attacking a wild boar, followed by a cut to the boar charging the swordsman and knocking him back.\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/098828e10c56e5c62af16b8a3bd78332.webm?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/098828e10c56e5c62af16b8a3bd78332.mp4?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR COMBAT STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly swap between melee and ranged weapons, casting spells, or throwing deadly concoctions during immersive, fast-paced action combat. Classless, fully flexible skill trees in Adventuring, Survival, Dungeoneering, Weaponry and the Oldways of Magic allow you to specialize or create clever combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/04121795658ec5bc981af2401b207670.poster.avif?t=1788246112\" aria-label=\"Animated GIF of a character walking through a tavern, a town square, and a field with cows.\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/04121795658ec5bc981af2401b207670.webm?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/04121795658ec5bc981af2401b207670.mp4?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>HANG OUT IN HANDCRAFTED TOWNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet local villagers who all have lives, stories and schedules of their own. Reveal quests by eavesdropping, deciphering rumors, and exploring strange ruins. Gather materials, craft items, cook meals for your party, and upgrade your gear before continuing your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/b9a4f56c1aca50c1ab31b5271eb60035.poster.avif?t=1788246112\" aria-label=\"Animated GIF showing characters creeping through a dungeon corridor and jumping back when a trap activates.\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/b9a4f56c1aca50c1ab31b5271eb60035.webm?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/b9a4f56c1aca50c1ab31b5271eb60035.mp4?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>SCHEDULING GAME NIGHT HAS NEVER BEEN EASIER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, or up to 4-player co-op with seamless drop-in/drop-out. Cloud-shared saves, group XP, and scaling difficulty all mean the party can continue with someone offline, but nobody gets left behind. Designed for busy gamers, campaigns have about 10 hours of story, and 15 hours of optional content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/de30deee47cda38651a0d06b780cf60d.poster.avif?t=1788246112\" aria-label=\"Split‑screen animated GIF showing two scenes: on one side, two characters dance in a tavern while a third cheers in the background; on the other, characters wave to each other as they walk toward one another.\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/de30deee47cda38651a0d06b780cf60d.webm?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/de30deee47cda38651a0d06b780cf60d.mp4?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>LOVINGLY CRAFTED BY A SMALL INDIE TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wyldheart is currently in Alpha, and we’re aiming to get it ready for Early Access later this year. If you’d like to stay updated on our release, you can Wishlist now or follow us at @wyldheartgame on most social networks. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/e13d1e693b780a755fdd448990037540.poster.avif?t=1788246112\" aria-label=\"Split-screen animated GIF showing characters being customized with different types of moustaches and beards, hair colours and styles, and skin tones.\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/e13d1e693b780a755fdd448990037540.webm?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/e13d1e693b780a755fdd448990037540.mp4?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>YOU ARE NOT THE CHOSEN ONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a humble peasant tossed into a dungeon, tasked with finding one of the ancient Relics of Caerwyn to protect your town. Choose to be a proud Freefolk, a little Mossling, or a towering Grimhorn, and pick from 19 backgrounds to begin your story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/098828e10c56e5c62af16b8a3bd78332.poster.avif?t=1788246112\" aria-label=\"Animated GIF of an archer, swordsman, and wizard attacking a wild boar, followed by a cut to the boar charging the swordsman and knocking him back.\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/098828e10c56e5c62af16b8a3bd78332.webm?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/098828e10c56e5c62af16b8a3bd78332.mp4?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR COMBAT STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly swap between melee and ranged weapons, casting spells, or throwing deadly concoctions during immersive, fast-paced action combat. Classless, fully flexible skill trees in Adventuring, Survival, Dungeoneering, Weaponry and the Oldways of Magic allow you to specialize or create clever combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/04121795658ec5bc981af2401b207670.poster.avif?t=1788246112\" aria-label=\"Animated GIF of a character walking through a tavern, a town square, and a field with cows.\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/04121795658ec5bc981af2401b207670.webm?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/04121795658ec5bc981af2401b207670.mp4?t=1788246112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>HANG OUT IN HANDCRAFTED TOWNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet local villagers who all have lives, stories and schedules of their own. Reveal quests by eavesdropping, deciphering rumors, and exploring strange ruins. Gather materials, craft items, cook meals for your party, and upgrade your gear before continuing your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/extras/b9a4f56c1aca50c1ab31b5271eb60035.poster.avif?t=1788246112\" aria-label=\"Animated GIF showing characters creeping through a dungeon corridor and jumping back when a trap activates.\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s