-op action RPG set in a rustic fantasy world. Start from nothing, and freely build your character as you investigate rumors, explore strange ruins, and survive the dangers threatening the fallen Kingdom of Caerwyn.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/2d0f1a365d127cb7294dd1be47d1af96ede20f80/header.jpg?t=1788246112", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/8cc331ff11df15cb45ca37510b524760fd289bce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788246112", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642910/8cc331ff11df15cb45ca37510b524760fd289bce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788246112", "website": "http://www.wyldheartgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 / RTX 2060 or AMD RX 5600 XT / RX 6600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> DX12 Ultimate, 1080p, Medium settings, 30 FPS, SSD required</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F / AMD Ryzen 5 5600 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 / RTX 2070 Super or AMD RX 6600 XT / RX 6700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</stro